  "title": "How to choose a Creator beyond follower count",
  "slug": "choosing-a-creator-beyond-follower-count",
  "slugHistory": [],
  "excerpt": "Three proposals, three polished videos: which one fits your brand? A comparison grid tied to your campaign goal, and the signals that should give you pause.",
  "type": "guide",
  "audience": "brands",
  "theme": "choose",
  "author": {
    "kind": "organization",
    "name": "AVYOR editorial team"
  },
  "featured": false,
